# Module 0: Smoke Test
# Run the API first (dotnet run --project src/Ticketing.Api), then send these one at a time.
# Use the port your API prints on startup.
@host = https://localhost:7001

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### List tickets
GET {{host}}/api/v1/tickets

### Get the seeded ticket
GET {{host}}/api/v1/tickets/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### Create a ticket
POST {{host}}/api/v1/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Printer on fire",
  "description": "Literally.",
  "priority": "Urgent",
  "requesterId": "bob"
}

### Read the chaos settings
GET {{host}}/dev/chaos

### Make the store slow (800 ms)
PUT {{host}}/dev/chaos
Content-Type: application/json

{ "latencyMs": 800, "errorRate": 0, "available": true }

### Turn chaos off
POST {{host}}/dev/chaos/reset
